        "custom_liquid": "<div class=\"asyii-price-intro\"><h2>Gift by price</h2><p>Every piece is independently designed and hand-finished in silk — OEKO-TEX certified, from a female-founded studio.</p></div><style>\n.asyii-price-intro{text-align:center;padding:44px 0 4px}\n.asyii-price-intro h2{font-size:1.5rem;line-height:1.25;margin:0 0 10px}\n.asyii-price-intro p{font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.6;opacity:.72;max-width:54ch;margin:0 auto}\n[id$=\"__section_UmmkqR\"] .section-content-wrapper{gap:0!important;padding-block-start:22px!important;padding-block-end:44px!important}\n[id$=\"__section_UmmkqR\"] .section-content-wrapper>.group-block{flex:1 1 0%!important;padding:2px 22px!important;min-width:0}\n[id$=\"__section_UmmkqR\"] .section-content-wrapper>.group-block+.group-block{border-inline-start:1px solid rgb(var(--color-foreground-rgb,0 0 0)/.14)}\n[id$=\"__section_UmmkqR\"] .icon-block__media{width:22px!important;height:22px!important;opacity:.5}\n[id$=\"__section_UmmkqR\"] h2{font-size:13px!important;letter-spacing:.11em!important;text-transform:uppercase;line-height:1.35;margin:0!important}\n[id$=\"__section_UmmkqR\"] p{font-size:13px!important;line-height:1.5;opacity:.72;margin:0!important}\n@media(max-width:749px){\n  .asyii-price-intro{padding:34px 0 0}\n  .asyii-price-intro h2{font-size:1.25rem}\n  [id$=\"__section_UmmkqR\"] .section-content-wrapper{gap:22px 0!important;flex-direction:row!important;flex-wrap:wrap!important;justify-content:center!important;padding-block-start:16px!important;padding-block-end:34px!important}\n  [id$=\"__section_UmmkqR\"] .section-content-wrapper>.group-block{flex:1 1 46%!important;padding:0 10px!important}\n  [id$=\"__section_UmmkqR\"] .section-content-wrapper>.group-block+.group-block{border-inline-start:none}\n  [id$=\"__section_UmmkqR\"] .section-content-wrapper>.group-block:nth-child(n+3){border-top:1px solid rgb(var(--color-foreground-rgb,0 0 0)/.12);padding-top:20px}\n}\n</style>",
